From f6536c24a092a3e6cd50e78c96221f750f5d2d08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DADA30000 <vadimhack.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 23:14:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: improve tree branch ordering, builtin fetcher support,
 and flicker-free rendering

- Add monotonic sequential event timestamps to preserve transfer arrival order in SortKey
- Propagate child summaries upward when creating parent links in lookup_derivation
- Add name-based tiebreaking for deterministic derivation ordering
- Support builtin fetchers (builtin:fetchurl, CA drvs): fallback to name for pname, recover outputs from env
- Display live transfer progress (file_transfer_progress) on running builds
- Fix terminal flickering with in-place line overwriting (\x1b[K)
- Display active downloads when forest_roots is empty
- Retain maximum expected download size on HTTP 206 retries
- Capture errors and traces across all verbosity levels while suppressing Talkative/Chatty debug logs
